  "description": "Koolage Cybersecurity Challenge Think you can spot a security vulnerability before an attacker does? Join the Koolage Cybersecurity Challenge and test your understanding of real-world application security. Participants will encounter practical cybersecurity scenarios involving: Web Application Security Authentication & Authorization API Security Common Vulnerabilities Security Analysis Cybersecurity Problem Solving What You'll Learn How common web vulnerabilities work How to identify security weaknesses How authentication differs from authorization How APIs can introduce security risks How security professionals approach vulnerability analysis Who Can Participate? Open to students and cybersecurity enthusiasts interested in: Cybersecurity Ethical Hacking VAPT Web Security API Security Application Security No advanced experience is required. Students with a basic understanding of cybersecurity are welcome. Challenge Format Participants will solve a series of cybersecurity-based questions and scenarios designed to test knowledge, analytical thinking, and problem-solving ability .",
